    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n8556" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">clāvĭger</span></b> ,
			gĕra, gĕrum, adj.,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>clubbearing;</i> as an epithet of Hercules [clavagero], <i>the club-bearer</i> (v. clava, 1.), <i><span class="en">Ov. M. 15,
				22</span></i>; <i><span class="en">15, 284</span></i>; <i><span class="en">id. F 1,
				544</span></i>; <i><span class="en">4, 68</span></i>.—Also of the robber
			Periphetes: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">clavigera proles,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Ov. M.
					7, 437</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">clavigerum numen,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Sil. 3,
					14</span></i>
			.</div>
